sequenceDiagram
    actor Op as Operator
    participant GP as GoPhish
    actor Emp as Employee
    participant LP as Landing + beacon.js
    participant BE as PhishAwareness API
    participant SE as Scoring engine
    participant UI as Console (our UI)

    Op->>UI: Launch campaign (confirm authorized)
    UI->>GP: launch using GoPhish-authored template and landing page
    Note over UI,GP: console orchestrates lifecycle, never authors lures
    GP->>Emp: Phishing simulation email
    Emp->>GP: Opens email
    GP-->>BE: webhook: Email Opened (HMAC-signed)
    Emp->>LP: Clicks link, lands on page
    LP-->>BE: beacon: dwell / field_focus (metadata only)
    GP-->>BE: webhook: Clicked Link
    Emp->>LP: Submits the form
    GP-->>BE: webhook: Submitted Data
    Note over BE: credentials dropped — stores InteractionEvent metadata only
    Op->>UI: "Sync now" (or real-time via webhook)
    UI->>BE: pull GoPhish results
    BE->>GP: GET /api/campaigns (read-only)
    Op->>UI: Recompute
    UI->>SE: recompute HRS from events
    SE-->>UI: HRS 61.1 (High) + compromise-depth ladder
